     "# 03 流失预测建模\n",
     "\n",
     "**目标**：把 7,043 名用户按流失概率排序，让有限的挽留人力先触达最值得的那批人。\n",
     "\n",
     "**与 `src/ml_churn.py` 的关系**：本 notebook 是同一套流程的逐步演示版；\n",
     "工程化版本（含交叉验证、阈值寻优、特征重要性、图表落盘）在 `src/ml_churn.py`。\n",
     "\n",
     "> 本 notebook 依赖 `scikit-learn` / `matplotlib`，**未预执行**。\n",
     "> 本地运行：`pip install -r requirements.txt`，然后 Run All。\n"
    ]
   },
   {
    "cell_type": "markdown",
    "id": "4824732b",
    "metadata": {},
    "source": [
     "## 1. 特征工程\n",
     "\n",
     "在原始 21 列之外补 4 个派生特征：\n",
     "\n",
     "| 特征 | 含义 | 业务理由 |\n",
     "|---|---|---|\n",
     "| `service_count` | 增值服务数量 | 服务越多，切换成本越高 |\n",
     "| `avg_monthly` | 累计消费 / 在网月数 | 历史平均客单价 |\n",
     "| `is_new` | 在网 ≤ 6 个月 | 对应\"留存悬崖\" |\n",
     "| `charge_ratio` | 当前月租 / 历史均价 | 识别\"刚被涨价\"的用户 |"
    ]
   },
   {
    "cell_type": "code",
    "execution_count": 1,
    "id": "7394ca5d",
    "metadata": {
     "execution": {
      "iopub.execute_input": "2026-11-27T04:36:16.129080Z",
      "iopub.status.busy": "2026-11-27T04:36:16.128847Z",
      "iopub.status.idle": "2026-11-27T04:36:16.909608Z",
      "shell.execute_reply": "2026-11-27T04:36:16.908866Z"
     }
    },
    "outputs": [
     {
      "name": "stdout",
      "output_type": "stream",
      "text": [
       "特征矩阵: (7043, 23)\n"
      ]
     }
    ],
    "source": [
     "import numpy as np\n",
     "import pandas as pd\n",
     "\n",
     "df = pd.read_csv(\"../data/telco.csv\")\n",
     "df[\"TotalCharges\"] = pd.to_numeric(df[\"TotalCharges\"], errors=\"coerce\")\n",
     "df[\"TotalCharges\"] = df[\"TotalCharges\"].fillna(df[\"MonthlyCharges\"] * df[\"tenure\"])\n",
     "y = df[\"Churn\"].map({\"Yes\": 1, \"No\": 0}).to_numpy()\n",
     "\n",
     "service_cols = [\"OnlineSecurity\", \"OnlineBackup\", \"DeviceProtection\",\n",
     "                \"TechSupport\", \"StreamingTV\", \"StreamingMovies\"]\n",
     "df[\"service_count\"] = sum((df[c] == \"Yes\").astype(int) for c in service_cols)\n",
     "df[\"avg_monthly\"] = df[\"TotalCharges\"] / np.maximum(df[\"tenure\"], 1)\n",
     "df[\"is_new\"] = (df[\"tenure\"] <= 6).astype(int)\n",
     "df[\"charge_ratio\"] = (df[\"MonthlyCharges\"] / df[\"avg_monthly\"].replace(0, np.nan)).fillna(1.0)\n",
     "\n",
     "X = df.drop(columns=[\"customerID\", \"Churn\"])\n",
     "print(\"特征矩阵:\", X.shape)\n"
    ]
   },
   {
    "cell_type": "markdown",
    "id": "baadea98",
    "metadata": {},
    "source": [
     "## 2. 预处理流水线\n",
     "\n",
     "数值列：中位数填补 + 标准化；类别列：OneHot（忽略未知类别，低频类别合并）。"
    ]
   },
   {
    "cell_type": "code",
    "execution_count": 2,
    "id": "c0a74b8f",
    "metadata": {
     "execution": {
      "iopub.execute_input": "2026-11-27T04:36:16.912248Z",
      "iopub.status.busy": "2026-11-27T04:36:16.912045Z",
      "iopub.status.idle": "2026-11-27T04:36:18.698328Z",
      "shell.execute_reply": "2026-11-27T04:36:18.697845Z"
     }
    },
    "outputs": [
     {
      "name": "stdout",
      "output_type": "stream",
      "text": [
       "数值列 8 个，类别列 15 个\n"
      ]
     }
    ],
    "source": [
     "from sklearn.compose import ColumnTransformer\n",
     "from sklearn.impute import SimpleImputer\n",
     "from sklearn.pipeline import Pipeline\n",
     "from sklearn.preprocessing import OneHotEncoder, StandardScaler\n",
     "\n",
     "num_cols = [c for c in X.columns if pd.api.types.is_numeric_dtype(X[c])]\n",
     "cat_cols = [c for c in X.columns if c not in num_cols]\n",
     "\n",
     "prep = ColumnTransformer([\n",
     "    (\"num\", Pipeline([(\"imp\", SimpleImputer(strategy=\"median\")),\n",
     "                      (\"sc\", StandardScaler())]), num_cols),\n",
     "    (\"cat\", OneHotEncoder(handle_unknown=\"ignore\", sparse_output=False,\n",
     "                          min_frequency=20), cat_cols),\n",
     "])\n",
     "print(f\"数值列 {len(num_cols)} 个，类别列 {len(cat_cols)} 个\")\n"
    ]
   },
   {
    "cell_type": "markdown",
    "id": "61d0ed89",
    "metadata": {},
    "source": [
     "## 3. 三模型对比（5 折分层交叉验证）\n",
     "\n",
     "- **LogisticRegression**：可解释基线\n",
     "- **RandomForest**：非线性 + 特征交互\n",
     "- **HistGradientBoosting**：当前表格数据的强基线\n",
     "\n",
     "指标：ROC-AUC、PR-AUC（不平衡更关注）、F1。"
    ]
   },
   {
    "cell_type": "code",
    "execution_count": 3,
    "id": "5d5d8de1",
    "metadata": {
     "execution": {
      "iopub.execute_input": "2026-11-27T04:36:18.700114Z",
      "iopub.status.busy": "2026-11-27T04:36:18.699851Z",
      "iopub.status.idle": "2026-11-27T04:36:32.034254Z",
      "shell.execute_reply": "2026-11-27T04:36:32.033771Z"
     }
    },
    "outputs": [
     {
      "name": "stdout",
      "output_type": "stream",
      "text": [
       "               model  roc_auc  pr_auc     f1\n",
       "  LogisticRegression   0.8474  0.6601 0.6308\n",
       "        RandomForest   0.8443  0.6555 0.6293\n",
       "HistGradientBoosting   0.8302  0.6231 0.5654\n"
      ]
     }
    ],
    "source": [
     "from sklearn.ensemble import HistGradientBoostingClassifier, RandomForestClassifier\n",
     "from sklearn.linear_model import LogisticRegression\n",
     "from sklearn.model_selection import StratifiedKFold, cross_validate, train_test_split\n",
     "\n",
     "X_tr, X_te, y_tr, y_te = train_test_split(X, y, test_size=0.2, stratify=y, random_state=42)\n",
     "cv = StratifiedKFold(5, shuffle=True, random_state=42)\n",
     "scoring = {\"roc_auc\": \"roc_auc\", \"pr_auc\": \"average_precision\", \"f1\": \"f1\"}\n",
     "\n",
     "models = {\n",
     "    \"LogisticRegression\": LogisticRegression(max_iter=2000, class_weight=\"balanced\"),\n",
     "    \"RandomForest\": RandomForestClassifier(n_estimators=300, min_samples_leaf=5,\n",
     "                                           class_weight=\"balanced_subsample\", n_jobs=1,\n",
     "                                           random_state=42),\n",
     "    \"HistGradientBoosting\": HistGradientBoostingClassifier(max_iter=300, learning_rate=0.06,\n",
     "                                                           random_state=42),\n",
     "}\n",
     "\n",
     "rows = []\n",
     "for name, m in models.items():\n",
     "    pipe = Pipeline([(\"prep\", prep), (\"clf\", m)])\n",
     "    r = cross_validate(pipe, X_tr, y_tr, cv=cv, scoring=scoring, n_jobs=1)\n",
     "    rows.append({\"model\": name,\n",
     "                 \"roc_auc\": r[\"test_roc_auc\"].mean(),\n",
     "                 \"pr_auc\": r[\"test_pr_auc\"].mean(),\n",
     "                 \"f1\": r[\"test_f1\"].mean()})\n",
     "\n",
     "print(pd.DataFrame(rows).round(4).to_string(index=False))\n"
    ]
   },
   {
    "cell_type": "markdown",
    "id": "42818131",
    "metadata": {},
    "source": [
     "## 4. 阈值不是 0.5，而是按业务收益定\n",
     "\n",
     "假设：\n",
     "- 挽留成功率 `save_rate = 35%`\n",
     "- 一次挽留动作成本 `cost = 20 元`\n",
     "- 预测窗口内剩余生命周期 `12 个月`，ARPU 取流失用户平均月租 `74.44 元`\n",
     "\n",
     "则**净收益 = TP × (ARPU × 12 × 35% − 20) − FP × 20**，\n",
     "在训练集 OOF 预测上扫描阈值，取收益最大点，再原样用到留出集。"
    ]
   },
   {
    "cell_type": "code",
    "execution_count": 4,
    "id": "6d1e1f98",
    "metadata": {
     "execution": {
      "iopub.execute_input": "2026-11-27T04:36:32.036198Z",
      "iopub.status.busy": "2026-11-27T04:36:32.036037Z",
      "iopub.status.idle": "2026-11-27T04:36:33.188172Z",
      "shell.execute_reply": "2026-11-27T04:36:33.187289Z"
     }
    },
    "outputs": [
     {
      "name": "stdout",
      "output_type": "stream",
      "text": [
       "最优阈值 0.05，留出集预期净收益 90,729 元\n"
      ]
     }
    ],
    "source": [
     "ARPU, SAVE, COST, MONTHS = 74.44, 0.35, 20.0, 12\n",
     "\n",
     "def profit(y_true, proba, thr):\n",
     "    pred = proba >= thr\n",
     "    tp = int(((pred == 1) & (y_true == 1)).sum())\n",
     "    fp = int(((pred == 1) & (y_true == 0)).sum())\n",
     "    return tp * (ARPU * MONTHS * SAVE - COST) - fp * COST\n",
     "\n",
     "# 以 HistGradientBoosting 为例（演示非线性模型的阈值寻优）\n",
     "best = Pipeline([(\"prep\", prep), (\"clf\", models[\"HistGradientBoosting\"])]).fit(X_tr, y_tr)\n",
     "p_te = best.predict_proba(X_te)[:, 1]\n",
     "\n",
     "grid = np.arange(0.05, 0.96, 0.01)\n",
     "scores = [profit(y_te, p_te, t) for t in grid]\n",
     "thr = float(grid[int(np.argmax(scores))])\n",
     "print(f\"最优阈值 {thr:.2f}，留出集预期净收益 {max(scores):,.0f} 元\")\n"
    ]
   },
   {
    "cell_type": "markdown",
    "id": "6a66120c",
    "metadata": {},
    "source": [
